'''Primal Fear''' (因習村, ''Inshū-mura'') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
"Resistant" Effects UP (M): The effect of this ability is increased by 20%.

